The problem description says that disabling and re-enabling "Make or track payments" causes the issue. This toggle is handled by the `onToggle` function in the `makeOrTrackPaymentsTitle` object. When toggled off, it sets the reimbursement choice to "no". When toggled on, it sets it to "manual" if `hasVBA` is false or the currency is not supported, or "yes" if `hasVBA` is true.

The issue seems to be that after disabling and re-enabling, the reimbursement choice is set to "manual", but the UI is showing "Bank account" and "Authorized payer". This suggests that `hasVBA` is true, but the reimbursement choice is not being updated correctly to "yes".

